# Note: protocol/**/*.pb.go are **deliberately committed**; don't add ignore rules for them here.
# See "Generated output is committed to the repository" in the README for why.

# Local build output
/bin/
/build/

# JVM
.gradle/
jvm/**/build/
# The Kotlin compiler's session and error logs. Their file names carry timestamps and every build produces a new batch;
# committing them would only create endless diff noise, with no diagnostic value to anyone (when something really goes wrong
# the logs are local). Three errors-*.log files once slipped into git.
.kotlin/

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
